{"3810130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Maroxyn Drarea", "steam_appid": 3810130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/bef3a7502219d35cf17732cb7fc75c48.avif?t=1787424266\" width=733 height=119 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A challenging, intentionally hostile first-person survival horror game with no combat, no safety, and little guidance. Survive a deliberately disorienting environment, manage your limited abilities, and find your escape.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are trapped in a hostile, fog-filled world and must find and activate the six hidden sigils to escape. The world is large, disorienting, and designed to make you lose your way.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival depends entirely on how you use your spells.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/65027db644993db446890c854bfe4366.webp?t=1787424266\" width=419 height=34 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies are active throughout the world and respond to spell usage.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There is no combat and you cannot fight back.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Death respawns you at a different location in the world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/7997e48d7a58b23d42bfd45b94556e12.webp?t=1787424266\" width=160 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Six sigils are hidden across the world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charging a sigil is slow and unstable.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each charged sigil raises a corresponding pillar at the Tree.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Once all pillars are raised, the final sigil can be charged to open the portal.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/8e73c30c90595ad17dd34bb917881316.poster.avif?t=1787424266\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/8e73c30c90595ad17dd34bb917881316.webm?t=1787424266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/8e73c30c90595ad17dd34bb917881316.mp4?t=1787424266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/9b639ad413c1ad84d710f0ada460e255.webp?t=1787424266\" width=211 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You have access to three spells. Each spell has a cost and introduces risk.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lucent – Used as your primary light source and the key to charging sigils. Can be converted into a projectile to illuminate distant terrain. Prolonged use can attract enemies.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/f6d9289ba90f9d87354496272c1f072a.poster.avif?t=1787424266\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/f6d9289ba90f9d87354496272c1f072a.webm?t=1787424266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/f6d9289ba90f9d87354496272c1f072a.mp4?t=1787424266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Descry – Scans the environment and reveals terrain details and sigil markers within range. Using it can cause enemies to appear.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/eaf3bb3714d8978e6c7404e43d3b2542.poster.avif?t=1787424266\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/eaf3bb3714d8978e6c7404e43d3b2542.webm?t=1787424266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/eaf3bb3714d8978e6c7404e43d3b2542.mp4?t=1787424266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ward – A shield that absorbs damage instead of health. When broken, it takes time to regenerate, leaving you vulnerable.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/7b509998a81361790052ca22ca4b1331.poster.avif?t=1787424266\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/7b509998a81361790052ca22ca4b1331.webm?t=1787424266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/7b509998a81361790052ca22ca4b1331.mp4?t=1787424266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/ce0270eac59f02f2714947df37a6f33e.webp?t=1787424266\" width=729 height=24 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/bef3a7502219d35cf17732cb7fc75c48.avif?t=1787424266\" width=733 height=119 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A challenging, intentionally hostile first-person survival horror game with no combat, no safety, and little guidance. Survive a deliberately disorienting environment, manage your limited abilities, and find your escape.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are trapped in a hostile, fog-filled world and must find and activate the six hidden sigils to escape. The world is large, disorienting, and designed to make you lose your way.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival depends entirely on how you use your spells.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/65027db644993db446890c854bfe4366.webp?t=1787424266\" width=419 height=34 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies are active throughout the world and respond to spell usage.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There is no combat and you cannot fight back.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Death respawns you at a different location in the world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/7997e48d7a58b23d42bfd45b94556e12.webp?t=1787424266\" width=160 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Six sigils are hidden across the world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charging a sigil is slow and unstable.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each charged sigil raises a corresponding pillar at the Tree.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Once all pillars are raised, the final sigil can be charged to open the portal.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/8e73c30c90595ad17dd34bb917881316.poster.avif?t=1787424266\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/8e73c30c90595ad17dd34bb917881316.webm?t=1787424266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/8e73c30c90595ad17dd34bb917881316.mp4?t=1787424266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/9b639ad413c1ad84d710f0ada460e255.webp?t=1787424266\" width=211 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You have access to three spells. Each spell has a cost and introduces risk.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lucent – Used as your primary light source and the key to charging sigils. Can be converted into a projectile to illuminate distant terrain. Prolonged use can attract enemies.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/f6d9289ba90f9d87354496272c1f072a.poster.avif?t=1787424266\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/f6d9289ba90f9d87354496272c1f072a.webm?t=1787424266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/f6d9289ba90f9d87354496272c1f072a.mp4?t=1787424266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Descry – Scans the environment and reveals terrain details and sigil markers within range. Using it can cause enemies to appear.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/eaf3bb3714d8978e6c7404e43d3b2542.poster.avif?t=1787424266\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/eaf3bb3714d8978e6c7404e43d3b2542.webm?t=1787424266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/eaf3bb3714d8978e6c7404e43d3b2542.mp4?t=1787424266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ward – A shield that absor